  "en": {
    "kind": "Anthology",
    "about": [
      "A triple album of 35 songs spanning almost forty years (1947–1985), in new orchestrations conducted by the composer, with his own notes in the booklet. An “autobiography” in songs: from “Chartino to feggaraki” and “Kourasmeno pallikari” to “Pornografia” and “I balanta ton aisthiseon”."
